   "cover_letter": "Bright Travel\u2019s travel\u2011related vision challenges demand a model that runs fast on NVIDIA Jetson. I delivered a 9k\u2011frame object detector for Faisal Textiles that achieved 0.91 recall at 25\u202fFPS on edge devices, proving the speed and accuracy required (da1d33400b24:0, 4e5e93e7dc09:0). I have hands\u2011on experience with TensorRT, Albumentations, PyTorch, OpenCV and Jetson (5870d2977579:0, 37b10073bbdd:0, cf40b1add91a:0). I will incorporate XGBoost for any classification or regression components, as I have used it successfully in prior projects (cf40b1add91a:0). First\u2011week plan: (1) set up the data pipeline and augmentations with Albumentations; (2) train a baseline detector in PyTorch, convert it to TensorRT and benchmark on Jetson; (3) deliver a working slice, test suite and documentation. I can start immediately at $42\u202f/hr. Drafted with AI assistance and reviewed by me before sending.",
