   "cover_letter": "You need a prompt\u2011injection mitigation layer for your retail chatbot so hidden text can\u2019t manipulate the agent. In a recent project for Safarnama I reduced attack success from 34% to 3% by adding untrusted\u2011content delimiting, permission tiers and a red\u2011team test suite (evidence: 635579365bc1:0). I will deliver a working slice in the first week: (1) set up pydantic models for input validation, (2) integrate Microsoft Presidio for PII masking, (3) add pytest\u2011based detection tests, and (4) document the module for your team. I\u2019ll run a quick red\u2011team test on day\u202f5 and review progress with you twice a week. My codebase already includes guardrails, pytest, pydantic and Presidio in the requirements (evidence: 2beeeaf3f8dc:0, d53fbfcd4b93:0, 635579365bc1:0). The hourly rate is $41.0. I\u2019ll focus on AI\u2011safety best practices and deliver the detection and sanitization module, unit tests, data models and deployment guide within the 7\u2011day window. Drafted with AI assistance and reviewed by me before sending.",
