   "cover_letter": "You need an A/B\u2011tested recommendation prototype that handles cold\u2011start users and a reliable image\u2011labeling pipeline. I delivered a matrix\u2011factorisation recommender for Sunwave Audio that lifted home\u2011feed click\u2011through 22% (evidence 13262f9f4049) and ran an A/B test for Threadline that boosted conversion in the first week (evidence 993ed583f849). I also built NumPy\u2011based data pipelines that reduced zero\u2011result queries from 12% to 3% (evidence f5c8f4598889). \n\nFirst\u2011week plan:\n1. Audit your data, define success metrics, and set up a reproducible NumPy pipeline for matrix factorisation.\n2. Prototype collaborative\u2011filtering with matrix factorisation and a content\u2011based fallback for cold\u2011start users.\n3. Implement an A/B testing harness around the prototype to compare variants.\n4. Create an image\u2011labeling pipeline by fine\u2011tuning a small LLM on your image metadata, running batch inference, and storing labels for downstream use.\n5. Deliver documentation, deployment scripts, and a kickoff review.\n\nFixed price: $910. Drafted with AI assistance and reviewed by me before sending.",
